2026-03-06 11:55:15 [INFO] oak_vision_system.modules.can_communication.virtual_can_communicator: 功能说明:
2026-03-06 11:55:15 [INFO] oak_vision_system.modules.can_communication.virtual_can_communicator:   • 这是一个虚拟实现，用于开发和测试环境
2026-03-06 11:55:15 [INFO] oak_vision_system.modules.can_communication.virtual_can_communicator:   • 会订阅 PERSON_WARNING 事件并记录详细日志
2026-03-06 11:55:15 [INFO] oak_vision_system.modules.can_communication.virtual_can_communicator:   • 支持坐标请求模拟，调用真实的决策层接口
2026-03-06 11:55:15 [INFO] oak_vision_system.modules.can_communication.virtual_can_communicator:   • 维护统计计数器，帮助验证事件流
2026-03-06 11:55:15 [INFO] oak_vision_system.modules.can_communication.virtual_can_communicator: 
2026-03-06 11:55:15 [INFO] oak_vision_system.modules.can_communication.virtual_can_communicator: 真实环境行为说明:
2026-03-06 11:55:15 [INFO] oak_vision_system.modules.can_communication.virtual_can_communicator:   • 真实环境下会使用 CANCommunicator 连接实际的 CAN 总线
2026-03-06 11:55:15 [INFO] oak_vision_system.modules.can_communication.virtual_can_communicator:   • 会连接到 socketcan 接口
2026-03-06 11:55:15 [INFO] oak_vision_system.modules.can_communication.virtual_can_communicator:   • 使用通道 can0，波特率 250000
2026-03-06 11:55:15 [INFO] oak_vision_system.modules.can_communication.virtual_can_communicator:   • 会发送实际的 CAN 消息到硬件设备
2026-03-06 11:55:15 [INFO] oak_vision_system.modules.can_communication.virtual_can_communicator:   • 会接收来自硬件的坐标请求消息
2026-03-06 11:55:15 [INFO] oak_vision_system.modules.can_communication.virtual_can_communicator: 
