2026-03-06 13:54:13 [INFO] oak_vision_system.modules.can_communication.virtual_can_communicator:   • 真实环境下会使用 CANCommunicator 连接实际的 CAN 总线
2026-03-06 13:54:13 [INFO] oak_vision_system.modules.can_communication.virtual_can_communicator:   • 会连接到 socketcan 接口
2026-03-06 13:54:13 [INFO] oak_vision_system.modules.can_communication.virtual_can_communicator:   • 使用通道 can0，波特率 250000
2026-03-06 13:54:13 [INFO] oak_vision_system.modules.can_communication.virtual_can_communicator:   • 会发送实际的 CAN 消息到硬件设备
